    "걷기 기록이 꺼져 있어요. 걸어도 길이 남지 않아요." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걷기 기록이 꺼져 있어요. 걸어도 길이 남지 않아요."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Walk tracking is off. Your path won't be saved as you walk."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Walk tracking is off. Your path won't be saved as you walk."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "歩行記録がオフです。歩いても道は残りません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "步行记录已关闭。走再多路也不会留下轨迹。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "步行紀錄已關閉。走再多路也不會留下軌跡。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El registro de caminatas está desactivado. Aunque camines, no quedará rastro."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Wegaufzeichnung ist aus. Auch wenn du gehst, bleibt keine Spur."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "L’enregistrement des marches est désactivé. Même en marchant, aucune trace ne sera gardée."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "걷다가 스탬프를 찍으면 여기에 시간 순서대로 쌓입니다.\n머문 자리는 찍지 않아도 저절로 남습니다." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "걷다가 스탬프를 찍으면 여기에 시간 순서대로 쌓입니다.\n머문 자리는 찍지 않아도 저절로 남습니다."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stamps you place while walking pile up here in time order.\nPlaces you stay at are saved on their own, no stamp needed."
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stamps you place while walking pile up here in time order.\nPlaces you stay at are saved on their own, no stamp needed."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "歩きながらスタンプを押すと、ここに時間順に積み重なります。\n滞在した場所は、押さなくても自動で残ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "步行时盖下的图章会按时间顺序堆叠在这里。\n停留过的地方即使不盖章也会自动保留。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "步行時蓋下的印章會依時間順序堆疊在這裡。\n停留過的地方即使不蓋章也會自動保留。"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los sellos que pongas al caminar se apilan aquí en orden cronológico.\nLos lugares donde te detienes se guardan solos, sin sellar."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stempel, die du beim Gehen setzt, stapeln sich hier in zeitlicher Reihenfolge.\nOrte, an denen du verweilst, werden auch ohne Stempel von selbst festgehalten."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les tampons posés en marchant s’empilent ici par ordre chronologique.\nLes lieux où vous restez sont gardés tout seuls, sans tampon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "걸어서 닿은 곳" : {
      "localizations" : {
